OL,3,AThree dead, eight injured in
OL,4,APhilippines school shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been killed and eight
OL,7,Finjured in a shooting at a high school
OL,8,Fin Banga in the province of Mindanao,
OL,9,Fsouthern Philippines.
OL,11,FTwo of the victims were 14-year-old
OL,12,Fstudents, Banga mayor Albert Palencia
OL,13,Ftold the BBC. The gunman, 16, is among
OL,14,Fthe dead, he said, while four of those
OL,15,Finjured are in a critical condition.
OL,17,FThe incident happened on Friday
OL,18,Fafternoon at Banga National High
OL,19,FSchool.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
